    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "body": "Please leave your feedback about new [mini.colors](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/readmes/mini-colors.md) module here. Feel free to either add new comment or positively upvote existing one.\r\n\r\nSome things I am interested to find out (obviously, besides bugs):\r\n\r\n- Are configuration and function names intuitive enough?\r\n- Are default values of settings convenient for you?\r\n- Is documentation and examples clear enough?\r\n\r\nThanks!",
