            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "As I said on Reddit, this module is fantastic. The _only_ thing I think could be improved is, when calling `:write`, test for the `background` value to preserve the original colorscheme file's light/dark variants.\n\n(Just wanted to put it here, since a forum isn't the best place to track those things)",
